Package: maluos-apple-t2-support
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.12), kmod, pciutils
Recommends: apple-bce-dkms
Description: MaluOS support for Intel Macs with the T2 chip
 What MaluOS adds around the drivers on a 2018-or-later Intel Mac: the
 import of the Mac's own Wi-Fi and Bluetooth firmware from its EFI
 partition (maluos-apple-firmware, run at boot and by the installer), the
 T2 bridge driver in the initrd, the Touch Bar and fan daemons gated to
 Apple hardware, and the t2linux firmware script for macOS. Part of the
 apple-t2 component (seeds/apple-t2.seed), which the installer selects on
 a T2 Mac; also on the live medium.
